==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Crawdaunt|92}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion, as was its '''Unruly Claw''' {{TCG|Ability}}.
**Both cards also have the {{m|Crabhammer}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Crawdaunt}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

